# Wave W17-J (Route 44): snow drift — the cave-mouth snow drift, a smooth banked drift of settled snow with a blue-shadowed foot and a sparkle on its crest, on cold turf (fully opaque, ground baked in). The design names the drift at the Frost Path mouth; the road’s snow keeps the shape the cave breath gives it.
